{"slug":"nightlife-entertainment","name":"Nightlife & Entertainment","subs":["Bars","Clubs","Live Music","Karaoke","Cinemas"],"seo":"Nights out in Cebu split three ways: the beach bars of Panagsama and Mactan, the clubs and rooftops around Mango Avenue and IT Park, and the karaoke rooms everyone ends up in eventually. Bars, clubs, live-music venues, KTV and cinemas — with area, price band and what kind of crowd to expect, so you pick the right room before midnight.","subSeo":{"Bars":"Beach bars, rooftops and neighbourhood joints — cold San Miguel, long happy hours and live acoustic sets.","Clubs":"Clubs and superclubs around Mango Avenue and IT Park, most filling up after midnight.","Live Music":"Venues with a stage: acoustic sets, bands and open mics. Being added — list yours here.","Karaoke":"KTV rooms by the hour, from family-friendly boxes to late-night private suites.","Cinemas":"Mall cinemas with current releases, IMAX and premium seats."},"items":[{"id":"ChIJeefXVwDpqzMRC4-ep-Zf-Do","name":"Tara Bar & Chill - Moalboal","tier":"Verified","subs":["Bars"],"sub":"Bars","area":"Moalboal","address":"W9XC+G3H, Moalboal, Cebu, Philippines","price":"$","rating":"5","reviews":"30","lat":9.94881,"lng":123.3702241,"maps":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Tara%20Bar%20%26%20Chill%20-%20Moalboal&query_place_id=ChIJeefXVwDpqzMRC4-ep-Zf-Do","website":"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61583274154937&sk=about_details","instagram":"","phone":"","telegram":"","whatsapp":"","messenger":"","liveChat":"","email":"","desc":"Tara Bar & Chill in Moalboal boasts a cozy yet vibrant atmosphere with a stylish layout, great music, and a striking moon-themed wall. Guests rave about the exceptionally welcoming staff and owner, delicious food, and affordable signature drinks like classic mojitos and frozen margaritas. Whether you are looking to unwind with a casual drink after work or party all night with a fun crowd, this spot is a must-visit in Basdiot.","prices":"","checked":"","photo":"","photoAlt":"","logo":"","logoAlt":""},{"id":"ChIJQZVl6grpqzMRwKb1KlfSOok","name":"SHARKEEZ RESTO BAR","tier":"Verified","subs":["Clubs"],"sub":"Clubs","area":"Moalboal","address":"Panagsama Rd, Basidot, Moalboal, 6032 Cebu, Philippines","price":"$","rating":"5","reviews":"23","lat":9.9496015,"lng":123.3679064,"maps":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=SHARKEEZ%20RESTO%20BAR&query_place_id=ChIJQZVl6grpqzMRwKb1KlfSOok","website":"https://www.facebook.com/share/1AKQkCfbnh/","instagram":"","phone":"+63 956 718 7125","telegram":"","whatsapp":"","messenger":"","liveChat":"","email":"","desc":"Sharkeez Resto Bar is a chill and welcoming spot in Moalboal featuring a spacious seating area, affordable drinks, and free pool. Visitors consistently praise the extraordinary hospitality of the friendly owners, great music, and vibrant atmosphere. Tucked just a short 30-step walk off the main road, keep in mind that food service might be limited during ongoing renovations and restrooms can occasionally lack supplies.","prices":"","checked":"","photo":"","photoAlt":"","logo":"","logoAlt":""},{"id":"ChIJpQmlSmWcqTMRkF43ZKwWXqU","name":"SM Cinema - SM Seaside City Cebu","tier":"Verified","subs":["Cinemas"],"sub":"Cinemas","area":"Cebu City","address":"SM Seaside City, F. Vestil St, Cebu City, 6000 Cebu, Philippines","price":"$$","rating":"4.5","reviews":"1388","lat":10.282264999999999,"lng":123.8807436,"maps":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=SM%20Cinema%20-%20SM%20Seaside%20City%20Cebu&query_place_id=ChIJpQmlSmWcqTMRkF43ZKwWXqU","website":"http://www.smcinema.com/","instagram":"","phone":"+63 2 8470 2222","telegram":"","whatsapp":"","messenger":"","liveChat":"","email":"","desc":"SM Cinema - SM Seaside City Cebu offers a clean and comfortable environment with solid audio quality for a classic movie outing. However, the experience can be marred by notably dim screen projections, lengthy snack counter delays due to understaffing, and serious pest concerns. Visitors are advised to skip the concession stand to avoid long waits and consider opting for brighter films rather than dark horror movies.","prices":"","checked":"","photo":"","photoAlt":"","logo":"","logoAlt":""},{"id":"ChIJyzl2dQCfqTMRpZE0AIHIIwY","name":"K1 Family KTV","tier":"Verified","subs":["Karaoke"],"sub":"Karaoke","area":"Cebu City","address":"8 Banawa Centrale, beside True Value, R. Duterte St, Cebu City, 6000 Cebu, Philippines","price":"$$","rating":"4.2","reviews":"66","lat":10.3110121,"lng":123.8764212,"maps":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=K1%20Family%20KTV&query_place_id=ChIJyzl2dQCfqTMRpZE0AIHIIwY","website":"","instagram":"","phone":"+63 945 326 7513","telegram":"","whatsapp":"","messenger":"","liveChat":"","email":"","desc":"K1 Family KTV offers a clean, comfortable, and exceptionally soundproofed environment that is perfect for both family outings and group gatherings. Highlights include high-quality sound systems with easy-to-use wireless mics, spacious rooms, and fun extra amenities like arcade machines and billiards. The accommodating staff is always quick to assist with equipment, making your karaoke session seamless. Practical tip: Take advantage of their very affordable pricing, such as beer buckets for 500 PHP, for a budget-friendly fun night out.","prices":"","checked":"","photo":"","photoAlt":"","logo":"","logoAlt":""},{"id":"ChIJZ-5SofGZqTMRumQoMXWanQ0","name":"Velvet Vortex Cebu","tier":"Free","subs":["Clubs"],"sub":"Clubs","area":"Cebu City","address":"APM Square, Andres, A. Soriano Ave, Cebu City, 6000 Cebu, Philippines","price":"$$","rating":"4.9","reviews":"591","lat":10.3143143,"lng":123.91821780000001,"maps":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Velvet%20Vortex%20Cebu&query_place_id=ChIJZ-5SofGZqTMRumQoMXWanQ0","website":"","instagram":"","phone":"+63 956 746 2435","telegram":"","whatsapp":"","messenger":"","liveChat":"","email":"","desc":"","prices":"","checked":"","photo":"","p